n assistant director. Mato reveals his plan to have Minare host a late night program with her name in the title.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k25c2ppPftpuaFWXsaCIqyT0bwr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k25c2ppPftpuaFWXsaCIqyT0bwr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94405/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2198069","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Manager Takarada gets in an accident so Minare goes back to working at Voyager. A mysterious woman, Makie Tachibana joins them to help out at the restaurant until Takarada recovers, but things start to get weird for Minare.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xJEpGI7oDF6QE6zkRVZI0u5S9eE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xJEpGI7oDF6QE6zkRVZI0u5S9eE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94405/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2198071","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After a sudden call from Mato, Minare goes on air for the first official episode of her program to give a fictitious report about how she killed Mitsuo, her ex-boyfriend.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A0MexJLakMVLZGfe7eSpqkWuPMi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A0MexJLakMVLZGfe7eSpqkWuPMi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94405/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2198072","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value"