/94405/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2198081","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Minare receives a text from Mitsuo and agrees to meet up. Despite all the inner turmoil, she ends up spending the whole day with him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aWHfiGMa3tnhR7gvk514v6dBDxV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWHfiGMa3tnhR7gvk514v6dBDxV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94405/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2198082","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nakahara gets bent out of shape when he finds out Minare went on a date with Mitsuo. At MRS, sound effect masters Kakoton and Kakoen join the crew for the next live radio drama broadcast.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dUpT55p5ZtsuXEyxoCZW2TFh9Hq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dUpT55p5ZtsuXEyxoCZW2TFh9Hq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94405/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2198083","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the radio drama, Minare faces a deity along with Mitsuo that will reincarnate them to the next life. In preparation for the next broadcast, Minare receives a lot of support from her friends.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eCM2xDTp26IQyAvRhnIuRekLQU2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eCM2xDTp26IQyAvRhnIuRekLQU2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.th